bds 3,0 "ACAS active resolution advisory"
date 2026-10-14
preamble
    Active resolution advisory state of the ACAS II unit: ARA bits
    (issued RA), RAC bits (prohibited manoeuvres) and threat identity.
    Source: ICAO Annex 10 Vol. IV, Mode S BDS register definition tables.

items

    BDSID "BDS Identifier"
        definition
            BDS register identifier, fixed 0x30.
        element 8
            unsigned integer

    ARA0 "RA Active"
        definition
            Any resolution advisory active.
        element 1
            table
                0: No RA issued
                1: RA issued

    ARA1 "Corrective RA"
        definition
            Corrective resolution advisory.
        element 1
            table
                0: No
                1: Yes

    ARA2 "Downward Sense"
        definition
            Downward sense resolution advisory.
        element 1
            table
                0: No
                1: Yes

    ARA3 "Increased Rate"
        definition
            Increased rate resolution advisory.
        element 1
            table
                0: No
                1: Yes

    ARA4 "Sense Reversal"
        definition
            Sense reversal resolution advisory.
        element 1
            table
                0: No
                1: Yes

    ARA5 "Altitude Crossing"
        definition
            Altitude crossing resolution advisory.
        element 1
            table
                0: No
                1: Yes

    ARA6 "Positive RA"
        definition
            Positive resolution advisory.
        element 1
            table
                0: No
                1: Yes

    spare 7

    RAC0 "No Below"
        definition
            Do not pass below threat.
        element 1
            table
                0: Allowed
                1: Prohibited

    RAC1 "No Above"
        definition
            Do not pass above threat.
        element 1
            table
                0: Allowed
                1: Prohibited

    RAC2 "No Left"
        definition
            Do not turn left.
        element 1
            table
                0: Allowed
                1: Prohibited

    RAC3 "No Right"
        definition
            Do not turn right.
        element 1
            table
                0: Allowed
                1: Prohibited

    RATERM "RA Terminated"
        definition
            Resolution advisory terminated.
        element 1
            table
                0: No
                1: Yes

    MULTITHREAT "Multiple Threat Encounter"
        definition
            Multiple threat encounter.
        element 1
            table
                0: No
                1: Yes

    TTI "Threat Type Indicator"
        definition
            Format of the threat identity data.
        element 2
            table
                0: No identity
                1: ICAO address
                2: Altitude, range and bearing
                3: Reserved

    TIDCASE "Threat Identity Variant"
        definition
            Threat identity data, layout depends on TTI.
        case TTI
            1:
                group
                    TID_ICAO "Threat ICAO Address"
                        definition
                            24-bit ICAO address of the threat.
                        element 24
                            raw
                    spare 2
            2:
                group
                    THREAT_ALT "Threat Altitude Code"
                        definition
                            13-bit altitude code of the threat.
                        element 13
                            unsigned integer
                        remark
                            Decoded to feet via the altcode rules.
                    THREAT_RANGE "Threat Range"
                        definition
                            Slant range to the threat.
                        element 7
                            unsigned integer
                        remark
                            Nautical miles = (raw - 1) / 10.
                    THREAT_BEARING "Threat Bearing"
                        definition
                            Bearing to the threat.
                        element 6
                            unsigned integer
                        remark
                            Degrees = 6 * (raw - 1) + 3.
            default:
                group
                    spare 26
